    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Use a self-designed image\nCommand **/dunganh <id>** (or /anhtay) as the caption of an image sent to the group, or typed right after sending the image (within 15 minutes).\n**Landscape** image (width/height ≥ 1.3) → **Zalo OA cover** (also the main image if the post has none); **square/portrait** → **post image** (Fanpage + group, only while pending approval).\nThe image is uploaded unpublished to the Fanpage to get a link → old version to **edit history** → write to the Sheet → confirm in the group. No AI, no logo/hotline overlay.",
